{"sub":"Tuesday 17 November 2026 · GBP/USD. Watches the London killzone so you do not have to trade it: a map at 06:40, the leg and its equilibrium at 10:00, a scorecard at noon. It never calls a trade.","feed":"<article class=\"post\"><div class=\"time\">06:40<small>Morning map</small></div><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\" style=\"--k:var(--blue)\">Morning map</span><h2>The nearest pool is above: the Asia high, 11 pips over price.</h2><p class=\"lede\">Before London opens, this is where the resting orders are and how often price has gone to get them by noon.</p><div class=\"plan\"><header><strong>GBP/USD · 1.31919</strong><span class=\"side map\">DRAW MAP</span></header><div class=\"pools\"><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Asia high<small>1.32031 · 11.2p above</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:44%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">44%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Asia low<small>1.31697 · 22.2p below</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:33%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">33%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">PDH<small>1.32247 · 32.8p above</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:15%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">15%</div></div></div></div><p>The previous day's low, 1.31774, is already spent: Asia took it at 01:30 (low 1.31697). Last week's low, 1.32057, sits just above the Asia high and was broken on Monday.</p><p>UK jobs and wages at 07:00. The first candle will be news, not structure.</p><p class=\"dim\">Watching only. Handover at 10:00.</p><section class=\"stage\" aria-label=\"Session chart\"><header><div><strong id=\"cPair\"></strong><small>15m · UK time</small></div><div class=\"views\" id=\"views\"></div></header>\n<svg class=\"chart\" id=\"chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Candlestick chart of the session with the desk's levels\"></svg><div class=\"pdk\" id=\"pdk\"></div><div class=\"scap\" id=\"cap\"></div></section></div></article>\n<article class=\"post\"><div class=\"time\">10:00<small>Handover</small></div><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\" style=\"--k:var(--copper)\">Killzone handover</span><h2>A 21-pip leg up that took the Asia high. Equilibrium is 1.31955.</h2><div class=\"plan\"><header><strong>GBP/USD</strong><span class=\"side map\">HANDOVER</span></header><dl><dt>Leg</dt><dd><span class=\"px \">1.31851</span> at 08:00 → <span class=\"px \">1.32058</span> at 09:45 · 20.7 pips up</dd><dt>Swept</dt><dd>Asia high <span class=\"px \">1.32031</span> in the 09:45 candle</dd><dt>Equilibrium</dt><dd><span class=\"px c\">1.31955</span> · 2.8 pips under price · returns by noon on <b>52%</b> of sessions</dd><dt>Still unspent</dt><dd>Asia low <span class=\"px \">1.31697</span> · PDH <span class=\"px \">1.32247</span></dd></dl></div><p>The leg finished on the sweep itself, so price is at the top of it with the high just taken. That is the spot this desk hands over: the level is set, the move is yours to judge.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"post\"><div class=\"time\">12:00<small>Scorecard</small></div><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\" style=\"--k:var(--gold)\">Scorecard</span><h2>Equilibrium went in the first candle. The leg was given back.</h2><div class=\"plan\"><header><strong>GBP/USD</strong><span class=\"side res\">SCORECARD</span></header><dl><dt>Equilibrium</dt><dd><span class=\"g\">Reached</span> at 10:00, the first candle after the handover</dd><dt>Asia low 1.31697</dt><dd><span class=\"r\">Not reached</span> · morning low <span class=\"px \">1.31851</span>, noon <span class=\"px \">1.31859</span></dd><dt>PDH 1.32247</dt><dd><span class=\"r\">Not reached</span> · high of the day 1.32058 at the sweep</dd><dt>Trades called</dt><dd>None. This desk names levels; it does not call a side.</dd></dl></div></div></article>","week":"<section class=\"week\"><h3>Meridian 2 · week of 16 Nov · old trade-call format, pips</h3><div class=\"wk\"><div class=\"\"><small>Mon</small><b class=\"r\">−10.0</b></d